OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested after boy injured
OL,4,Ain sword attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old, also from Gloucester,
OL,7,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fpossession of an offensive weapon,
OL,9,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm
OL,10,Fand affray.
